  "description": "FIBLIN crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C138 H165 La6 N24 O42 3+,3(Cl1 O4 1-). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.846-3.920 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.45-108.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La6L6(CH3O)3(CH3OH)3](ClO4)3.",
